      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Focus on the evolving threat landscape rather than their current configuration. Mention that while their existing controls are excellent against *known* threats, the Advanced package integrates threat intelligence feeds that track zero-day exploits and emerging attack vectors globally. You can subtly imply that their current system is reactive to what *was* known, whereas the premium tier is designed to anticipate what *will* be used against them next month. This shifts the discussion from a technical deficit to a strategic risk management necessity.",
